{"id":47766,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=47766"},"modified":"2026-10-02T09:42:27","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T08:42:27","slug":"lynxrace-oeiras","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/lynxrace-oeiras\/","title":{"rendered":"Lynxrace Oeiras 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Lynxrace Oeiras 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Lynxrace Oeiras 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa etapa do Circuito Lynx 2026) realiza-se no dia <strong>1 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong> na <strong>Quinta de Cima do Pal\u00e1cio do Marqu\u00eas de Pombal<\/strong> (no interior da Esta\u00e7\u00e3o Agron\u00f3mica Nacional), no concelho de <strong>Oeiras<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>. Esta emocionante prova de obst\u00e1culos desafia a for\u00e7a, agilidade e resist\u00eancia f\u00edsica dos participantes num cen\u00e1rio emblem\u00e1tico.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Podes optar pelo desafio de <strong>10 km com 30 obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> (nos formatos <em>Competitive<\/em>, com arbitragem rigorosa e p\u00f3dios, ou <em>Open<\/em>, orientado para a divers\u00e3o e supera\u00e7\u00e3o pessoal), pelo percurso de <strong>5 km com 20 obst\u00e1culos<\/strong> em formato Open, ou inscrever os mais novos nos <strong>2 km Kids<\/strong>. O secretariado abre \u00e0s 07:30 no local para rece\u00e7\u00e3o dos atletas e entrega de kits.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>Circuito LynxRace<\/strong>, contando com o apoio do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Oeiras<\/strong> para assegurar uma infraestrutura completa com balne\u00e1rios, seguran\u00e7a e cronometragem oficial.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=